	Clearly Illustrate the 1st Pinch Point: Provide a demonstration of the antagonist’s threat or power without filtering through the protagonist's perspective.
	Lead up to a Transformative Midpoint Revelation: Position the protagonist for a critical realization or discovery that changes their perspective.

